      "summary": "Replaces the LXQt/labwc desktop with KDE Plasma 6.7, set up the way SteamOS's desktop mode is.",
      "publishedAt": 1791557229000
    },
    {
      "commit": "0a9676765728ffc9de4d408578359cb2dfba99d4",
      "title": "Desktop: keep the session when the big cores cannot be pinned",
